1.  **Static Analysis:** Ensure imports are correct.
2.  **Unit Test:** Run [test_wellness_direct.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/test_wellness_direct.py) (if available) or create a targeted test script.
3.  **Manual Simulation:**
    -   Call [get_gemini_response("I am sad")](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/providers/gemini.py#187-405) -> Should trigger tool.
    -   Call [get_gemini_response("Hello")](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/providers/gemini.py#187-405) -> Should be chat.

