2.  [ ] Update [providers/gemini.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/providers/gemini.py) to import [DualEngineLLM](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py#13-160).
3.  [ ] Replace `genai.GenerativeModel` with [DualEngineLLM](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py#13-160).
4.  [ ] Verify "Tools Detected" log message (confirming fallback).
5.  [x] Verify Chat Response.

